 bindings = <
// ╷           ╷           ╷           ╷           ╷           ╷           ╷   ╷           ╷           ╷           ╷           ╷           ╷           ╷

                &none       &none       &none       &none       &none           &kp N7      &kp N8      &kp N9      &kp MINUS   &kp EQUAL
                &mt LGUI A  &mt LSHFT S &mt LCTRL D &mt LALT F  &trans          &kp N4      &kp N5      &kp N6      &none       &kp INS
    &none       &none       &none       &none       &none       &none           &kp N1      &kp N2      &kp N3      &kp DOT     &kp GRAVE   &trans
                                        &trans      &trans      &trans          &trans      &trans      &kp N0
