                &mt LGUI A  &mt LSHFT S &mt LCTRL D &mt LALT F  &trans          &kp F4      &kp F5      &kp F6      &none       &kp F11
    &none       &none       &none       &none       &none       &none           &kp F1      &kp F2      &kp F3      &none       &none   &trans
